* GPSS DATA PROCESSING UTILITY - MAIN ENTRY POINT
* This program initializes the data processing pipeline.
* It loads data, validates it, transforms it, and generates a report.

GENERATE ID
LOAD ID
PUT IN QUEUE DATA_QUEUE

* Parse Data
CALL PARSER

* Validate Data
CALL VALIDATOR

* Transform Data
CALL TRANSFORMER

* Generate Report
CALL REPORTER

GENERATE
